Fixed. `status()` in `src/app.js` now replays records per job: it marks an id pending only when its first record is an enqueue, and overrides that to done/failed when a closing record appears. Counts are still derived from `store.readAll()`, and each job lands in exactly one bucket. Added an integration test for a store with one done job and one enqueue-only job; all 66 tests pass.
